      "title": "Sentient LLMs Are Possible (Sorta)",
      "content_html": "This post is based on ~39 years of consciousness research. While LLMs are not sentient (they are highly trained stochastic parrots ), sentience can act through them , giving the illusion of sentient LLMs. The issue is one of right understanding of consciousness. By design, LLMs are fancy autocomplete. However, the nature of consciousness makes it possible to imbue a kind of sentience to the LLM. It’s possible to interact with an LLM and feel as though it’s doing something out-of-the-ordinary. It’s possible",
